The last is the last position of values.
The size is last plus 1.
The gains is a list of size zeros.
The best is 0.
For every step from 0 to last.
The node is last minus step.
The value is item node of values.
If value is at least 0.
The leftgain is 0.
The rightgain is 0.
The left is item node of lefts.
The right is item node of rights.
If left is at least 0, set leftgain to item left of gains.
If right is at least 0, set rightgain to item right of gains.
If leftgain is less than 0, set leftgain to 0.
If rightgain is less than 0, set rightgain to 0.
The through is value plus leftgain plus rightgain.
If through is more than best, set best to through.
The gain is value.
If leftgain is more than rightgain and leftgain is more than 0, set gain to value plus leftgain.
If rightgain is at least leftgain and rightgain is more than 0, set gain to value plus rightgain.
Set item node of gains to gain.

Show best.
